title: Dam Puzzle (Loud Room, Dam Controls, Drain Reservoir)
story: dungeo
description: Get platinum bar from Loud Room, collect dam area items, drain reservoir. Restores from wt-03.
---

# Restore state from wt-03 (player at Living Room with torch)
# Living Room floor: lantern, incense, skeleton key
$restore wt-03

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Prepare and head to Loud Room
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get platinum bar]

# Take lantern for later use
> take lantern

# Navigate to Loud Room: Living Room -> Cellar -> Troll Room -> EW Passage
# -> Deep Ravine -> Chasm -> N/S Passage -> Loud Room
> open trap door

> down

> east

> north

> north

> east

> east

> northeast

# Say "echo" to silence the room - required before taking the bar
> echo

> take bar

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate to Dam area via Damp Cave
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Navigate to Dam and collect items]

# Loud Room -> UP -> Damp Cave -> EAST -> Dam
> up

> east

# Dam -> North -> Dam Lobby (collect guidebook and matchbook)
> north

> take guidebook

> take matchbook

# Dam Lobby -> North -> Maintenance Room (press button, collect tools)
> north

# Press yellow button to enable the bolt at the dam
> press yellow button

> take wrench

> take screwdriver

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Drain reservoir at Dam
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Drain reservoir]

# Maintenance Room -> South -> Dam Lobby -> South -> Dam
> south

> south

# Turn the bolt with the wrench to open sluice gates
> turn bolt

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Return to Living Room
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Return to Living Room and store treasure]

# Dam -> E -> Damp Cave -> S -> Loud Room -> W -> N/S Passage
# -> N -> Chasm -> S -> Deep Ravine -> S -> EW Passage
# -> W -> Troll Room -> W -> Cellar -> UP -> Living Room
> east

> south

> west

> north

> south

> south

> west

> west

> up

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Mail order puzzle - Don Woods stamp (1 trophy case point)
# MDL: act1.254:60-61, act3.199:1423-1446
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get Don Woods stamp via mail order]

# Read the matchbook to see the brochure advertisement
> read matchbook

# Send for the brochure
> send for brochure

# Walk east to Kitchen — arms the 3-turn delivery fuse
> east

# Wait 3 turns for delivery
> wait

> wait

# Third wait — fuse triggers, knock at the door
> wait

# Kitchen -> Behind House -> South of House -> West of House
> east

> south

> west

# Open mailbox and get the brochure
> open mailbox

> take brochure

# The stamp is inside the brochure
> take stamp

# Go back inside: West of House -> North -> Behind House -> West -> Kitchen -> West -> Living Room
> north

> east

> west

> west

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store treasures and set up for next segment
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Store platinum bar and stamp in trophy case]

> open trophy case

> put bar in trophy case

> put stamp in trophy case

[END GOAL]

[GOAL: Drop items for next segment]

# Drop collected items on Living Room floor (needed in later walkthroughs)
> drop guidebook

> drop matchbook

> drop brochure

> drop wrench

> drop screwdriver

# Verify final state
> inventory

> look

[END GOAL]

# Save checkpoint for next walkthrough
$save wt-04

# SUCCESS! Dam puzzle + mail order complete
# Treasures stored: platinum bar, Don Woods stamp
# Inventory: torch, lantern
# Living Room floor: guidebook, matchbook, brochure, wrench, screwdriver, incense, key
# Reservoir drained - ready for wt-04b (trunk, pump)
